gpod-utils (1.4.17) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix podcast playback showing 'Unknown Artist' on iPod Classic 6th gen

    For podcast tracks with no artist tag, fall back to the album name
    (podcast show name), matching iTunes behaviour.

  * Set podcast episode release date from 'date' metadata tag

    gpod_ff_meta_to_track now copies date_released (already parsed from the
    'date' tag by parse_date) to track->time_released. The fallback to
    time_added in gpod-cp is preserved for files with no date tag.

 -- Ilya Kargapolov <d3vil.st@gmail.com>  Sat, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0200

