gpod-utils (1.4.15) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Convert PNG embedded cover art to JPEG when syncing to iPod

    extract_coverart only set pic_found for JPEG-encoded attached pictures,
    silently skipping PNG covers (the decoded frame was discarded). Remove the
    codec guard so any successfully decoded attached picture proceeds to
    encode_frame_to_jpeg, which scales to 300x300 and re-encodes as JPEG.
    The raw-packet fallback is still gated on is_jpeg since the iPod cannot
    display PNG thumbnails directly.

 -- Ilya Kargapolov <d3vil.st@gmail.com>  Sat, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0200

gpod-utils (1.4.14) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix Podcasts menu not navigable on iPod Classic 6th gen

    Set flag4=0x01 on podcast tracks (required by the 6th gen firmware to
    recognise a track as a properly configured podcast episode), populate
    time_released from time_added when absent (episode release date used for
    sorting), and set ITDB_PSO_RELEASE_DATE sort order on the Podcasts
    playlist when creating it, matching iTunes behaviour.

 -- Ilya Kargapolov <d3vil.st@gmail.com>  Sat, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0200

gpod-utils (1.4.13) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix FLAC-to-ALAC transcode failure on files with embedded cover art

    decode_audio_frame was passing a blank packet (data=NULL, size=0) to
    avcodec_send_packet when EOF was reached, instead of NULL. The FLAC
    decoder accepted the blank packet without error but then returned
    AVERROR_INVALIDDATA from avcodec_receive_frame, which was treated as
    fatal, aborting the transcode. Fix: send NULL when finished to properly
    flush the decoder, and also handle AVERROR_EOF from avcodec_send_packet
    as non-fatal alongside the existing AVERROR_INVALIDDATA case.

    Also add av_packet_unref() at the top of the stream-filtering loop so
    non-audio packets (e.g. attached cover art) are released before reading
    the next packet, matching the pattern used in gpod_ff_audio_hash.

 -- Ilya Kargapolov <d3vil.st@gmail.com>  Sat, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0200

gpod-utils (1.4.12) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix gpod-verify -d segfault when removing orphaned filesystem files

    The REMVE g_print had ++removed as the first variadic argument but the
    format string starts with %s, so g_print dereferenced the integer counter
    as a char pointer and crashed. Move ++removed to a separate statement,
    matching the pattern used by the ORPHN and ADD branches.

 -- Ilya Kargapolov <d3vil.st@gmail.com>  Sat, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0200

gpod-utils (1.4.11) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add podcast tracks to the Podcasts playlist so they appear under the
    Podcast menu rather than Music on iPod Classic

    The iPod routes tracks to the Podcast menu via a special playlist with
    podcastflag=1, not solely via mediatype. Without it, even a track with
    mediatype=PODCAST only appears under Music. Now creates the Podcasts
    playlist (using itdb_playlist_set_podcasts) if absent and adds each
    podcast track to it. Also sets mark_unplayed=0x02 so the unplayed bullet
    appears on the iPod.

 -- Ilya Kargapolov <d3vil.st@gmail.com>  Sat, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0200

gpod-utils (1.4.10) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix podcast/audiobook tracks appearing under Music instead of Podcast menu

    --tracks-media-type podcast/audiobook was OR-ing the specified type onto
    the default ITDB_MEDIATYPE_AUDIO, producing AUDIO|PODCAST (0x05) instead
    of plain PODCAST (0x04). The iPod routes by the AUDIO bit and shows such
    tracks under Music. Fix: -m handler now assigns (=) rather than OR-assigns
    (|=) opts.mediatype; _track() assigns track->mediatype directly from opts
    rather than OR-ing, preserving MOVIE for video files.

 -- Ilya Kargapolov <d3vil.st@gmail.com>  Sat, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0200

gpod-utils (1.4.9) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add audiobook/podcast playback flags and fix operator precedence bug

    Set remember_playback_position and skip_when_shuffling on tracks when
    -m audiobook or -m podcast is used, so the iPod Classic bookmarks
    playback position and excludes them from shuffle.

    Fix operator precedence bug in albums_index: the guard
    `track->mediatype & ITDB_MEDIATYPE_AUDIO == 0` was always false due to
    == binding tighter than &, causing video-only tracks to be incorrectly
    included in Recent playlists.

 -- Ilya Kargapolov <d3vil.st@gmail.com>  Sat, 27 Jun 2026 15:30:10 +0200

